# state: any   (classifier-path benchmark opening; #433 step 6c)
# Blinx: The Time Sweeper (4D530013), classifier-path benchmark (#433):
# drive generic replaces the blind opening and marks gameplay itself once
# play is confirmed. 3D platformer: run forward, turn, jump -- never START.
drive generic 300 mark
repeat forever {
    axis LY min
    wait 2.0
    axis LX max
    wait 1.0
    axis LX mid
    wait 1.0
    axis LX min
    wait 1.0
    axis LX mid
    press A 300
    wait 1.5
}
